  "hard_rules": [
    "wow-service is the only framework dependency",
    "each fixed tool maps to exactly one service operation",
    "tools and resources are repository-owned static versioned descriptors",
    "no generic tool service or JSON-RPC owner pass-through",
    "MCP specification transport framing capability and error behavior are exact frozen profiles",
    "provider results remain semantic_candidate and Candidate with no negative authority",
    "external locator mapping and explicit selection are separate required receipts before context",
    "top first best highest-score sole name path snippet or provider labels never select or prove",
    "opaque exact-generation resource URIs are never arbitrary paths URLs repositories or provider locators",
    "sampling elicitation prompts dynamic tools and automatic follow-up tool calls are absent",
    "client host model OS GitHub process file or repository identity never authorizes operations or raises authority",
    "source provider query review and prompt text remain structurally isolated untrusted data",
    "partial candidate conflict truncated OutcomeUnknown and NotEvaluated state is preserved",
    "stdout contains protocol only and broken output never repeats service",
    "no credentials private keys hidden review holdout data raw stores databases owner handles or private paths",
    "no background work after response cancellation shutdown or transport loss",
    "no Cargo Rust source or CI during documentation phase"
  ],
  "normative_files": [
