    "required_before_first_rust_implementation": [
      "implemented and frozen wow-service E7-A plus E6-B external candidate request result error authorization and canonical byte contracts",
      "exact official MCP specification revision and conformance vectors",
      "frozen stdio framing JSON-RPC initialization capabilities static tool resource cancellation progress error shutdown and platform profiles",
      "all tool-to-service and resource-to-artifact mappings with closed schemas and side-effect classifications",
